    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800022_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(I can calculate their discomfort index, <i>u</i>, to figure out the variation in their timing error...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00312_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "My? When did we return to base? No one woke me up today.",
